(text "BUCK - LT8645S  |  Analog Devices (LTC)  |  65V 8A Silent Switcher 2 synchronous buck, LQFN-32 6x4" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 14.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6099f285-0bd4-47a5-ace4-31a5532de04d"))
(text "Default build: VOUT = 3.3 V (fixed resistor divider - no trimmer). Other outputs: change only R_top/R_bot (and L where shown) per the VOUT table." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "367c53cb-40df-40b5-bc95-0345cb3d9a1b"))
(text "DESIGN EQUATIONS - LT8645S (Analog Devices LT8645S Rev E, Applications Information; replicates Fig.9)\nDesign point: VIN 12 V nom (6-65 V), VOUT 3.3 V, IOUT 8 A, fSW 500 kHz\nFB divider: R1 = R2*(VOUT/0.970 - 1) ; R1 = 1M, R2 = 412k -> VOUT = 3.324 V ; phase-lead CFF 2.2pF across R1\nFrequency: RT = 46.5/fSW[MHz] - 5.2 = 87.8k -> 88.7k (E96)\nInductor: L = (VOUT + VSW(BOT))/fSW[MHz] * 0.4 = 2.80 uH -> 3.3uH XAL7070-332ME\n  dIL = VOUT/(L*fSW)*(1-VOUT/VINmax) = 1.90 A ; IOUT(MAX) = ILIM - dIL/2 = 14 - 0.95 = 13.1 A\nEN/UV: VIN(EN) = (R3/R4 + 1)*1.01V ; R4 = 100k, VIN(EN) = 6.0 V -> R3 = 499k\nSoft-start: tSS = CSS*VFB/ISS = 10nF*0.97V/1.9uA = 5.1 ms ; PG 10k pull-up to VOUT (house-common) ; BIAS to VOUT\nSYNC/MODE to GND (Burst Mode); CLKOUT n/c. Silent Switcher: split CIN symmetrically across both VIN pin groups.\nGENERIC CHECKS @ VIN=12V nom / 65V max, VOUT=3.3V, IOUT=8A, fSW=500kHz\n  D = VOUT/VIN = 0.275\n  dIL = VOUT(1-VOUT/VIN)/(L*fSW): 1.45A @nom, 1.90A @max  (24% of IOUT)\n  IL_PK = IOUT + dIL/2 = 8.95A ; inductor ISAT must exceed 17.5A (max top-switch limit)  (XAL7070-332ME)\n  ICIN_RMS = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) = 3.57A (max IOUT/2 = 4.00A at D=0.5)\n  dVIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*CIN) = 997mV with CIN_eff=3.2uF\n  dVOUT_ripple = dIL/(8*fSW*COUT) = 6.0mV with COUT_eff=60uF (ESR excluded)\n  tON @VINmax = VOUT/(VIN*fSW) = 102ns vs tON_MIN(max)=65ns -> OK\n  Max VIN without pulse skipping = VOUT/(tON_MIN*fSW) = 101.5V\n  Min VIN (dropout) ~ (VOUT+IOUT*R)/(1-fSW*tOFF_MIN) = 3.92V\nIC THERMAL @ VIN nom, full load (datasheet Power Dissipation / thermal sections)\n  Pcond=IL_RMS^2*1.4*(D*RDS_HS+(1-D)*RDS_LS)=2.52W, Psw=0.5*VIN*IOUT*tsw*fSW=0.10W (tsw~4ns), Pq=0.04W\n  RDS_HS=36mOhm, RDS_LS=25mOhm typ (datasheet EC table)\n  PIC = 2.65W ; thetaJA = 17 C/W (ADI demo board) -> TJ = TA + thetaJA*PIC = 70C @25C, 130C @85C ; TA(max) for TJ=125C = 80C\n  Inductor DCR loss = IOUT^2*DCR = 0.69W" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9828d7ab-7c3f-415c-979a-0b22bb5c7259"))
